// Title: Phishing Pattern ISO in Archive
// Rule ID: fcdf69e5-a3d3-452a-9724-26f2308bf2b1
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1566
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_archiver_iso_phishing.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
